.Dd July 26, 2026
.Dt DIFF 8
.Os FreeBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm diff
.Nd detect drift between a deployed workspace and its recipe
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl s Ar name
.Op Fl k Ar kind
.Op Fl h
.Op Fl d
.Op Fl q
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility is part of the parasa framework for FreeBSD system management.
It compares a live system or container tree against its
.Pa mtree.dist
specification and classifies each changed file.
.Pp
The comparison proceeds as follows:
.Bl -enum
.It
Resolve the target tree root and recipe directory.
.It
Run
.Xr mtree 8
comparison against
.Pa mtree.dist .
.It
For each changed file, classify it:
.Bl -dash
.It
In exempt mount (var/, usr/local/, home/, tmp/) \(em skip.
.It
Text file \(em git handles it during rebase.
.It
Known derivation (found in derivations database) \(em auto-classified.
.It
Git-tracked binary \(em preserve (kept as-is across rebases).
.It
Unclassified \(em prompt interactively or exit 1 in quiet mode.
.El
.It
Exit 0 if all changes are classified; exit 1 if unclassified remain.
.El
.Pp
Interactive classification options:
.Bl -tag -width "[d]"
.It [d] Derivation
A text source that gets git-merged, then a command regenerates this binary.
Appends to
.Pa derivations.local .
.It [p] Preserve
Non-derivable binary, kept as-is across rebases.
Added to git tracking.
.It [c] Command
Binary produced from scratch by a command, no text source dependency.
Appends to
.Pa compose.sh .
.It [s] Skip
Ask again next time.
Blocks rebase.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-k KIND"
.It Fl h
Print a usage summary and exit.
.It Fl d
Dry run.
Show what would be compared without running mtree.
.It Fl s Ar name
Specify the workspace name.
This option is required.
.It Fl k Ar kind
Specify "system" or "container".
Auto-detected from recipes directory if omitted.
.It Fl q
Quiet mode.
No interactive prompts; exit 1 if unclassified files remain.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "recipes/{kind}s/<name>/derivations.local"
.It Pa recipes/{kind}s/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac Ns Pa /mtree.dist
Specification file for comparison.
.It Pa recipes/{kind}s/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac Ns Pa /derivations.local
Per-target derivation mappings (source, derived, command).
.It Pa etc/derivations/15.0.db
Global derivation database for FreeBSD 15.0.
Version-resolved: the newest db whose version is <= the target's FreeBSD version.
.It Pa etc/mtree.ignore
Paths excluded from mtree comparison.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Pp
Exit 0 if no drift or all changes classified.
Exit 1 if unclassified changes remain.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr save 8 ,
.Xr update 8 ,
.Xr mtree 8
.Sh AUTHORS
The
.Nm
utility is part of the parasa framework.
